# Lady Octopus, Inspired Inventor gets an ingenuity counter for each of the first two cards Bot1 draws each turn
# (CR 120.3): none for Bot2's draw on turn 2, one for Bot1's draw step on turn 3, one for the first Opt's draw, none
# for the second Opt's (the third card). With two counters her {T} ability casts an artifact spell of mana value 2 or
# less from Bot1's hand for free (CR 608.2g, 118.9): Coalition Relic (3) is not offered, nor is Consider (1), no artifact; Mind Stone (2) is, and is cast
# with no mana spent. On turn 5 the count starts again, and the draw step's card makes three counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Lady Octopus, Inspired Inventor
Mind Stone
Coalition Relic
Opt
Opt
Consider
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

